 msgid "The original image and its channels"
-msgstr ""
+msgstr "Originalbilden och dess kanaler"
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:131(para)
+#| msgid ""
+#| "RGB values of the pixels in red, green, blue, gray squares are displayed. "
+#| "The black rectangle is special, because black (0;0;0) is not concerned by "
+#| "the command (0 multiplied by any percentage always gives 0). The result "
+#| "can't exceed 255 nor be negative."
 msgid ""
 "RGB values of the pixels in red, green, blue, gray squares are displayed. "
-"The black rectangle is special, because black (0;0;0) is not affected by the "
-"command (0 multiplied by any percentage always gives 0). The result can't "
+"The black rectangle is special, because black (0;0;0) is not affected by the"
+" command (0 multiplied by any percentage always gives 0). The result can't "
 "exceed 255 nor be negative."
 msgstr ""
+"RGB-värdena för bildpunkterna i de röda, gröna, blå och grå rutorna visas. "
+"Den svarta rektangeln är speciell eftersom svart (0;0;0) inte påverkas av "
+"kommandot: 0 multiplicerat med en procentandel blir alltid 0. Resultatet kan"
+" varken överstiga 255 eller bli negativt."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:142(title)
 msgid "Output channel is red. Green Channel +50"
-msgstr ""
+msgstr "Utdatakanalen är röd. Grön kanal +50"
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:149(para)
+#| msgid ""
+#| "In the red square, the pixel values are 230;10;10. Relative values are "
+#| "1;0.5;0. The calculation result is 230*1 + 10*0,5 + 10*0 =235. The same "
+#| "reasoning is valid for the green and the blue squares."
 msgid ""
 "In the red square, the pixel values are 230;10;10. Relative values are "
 "1;0.5;0. The calculation result is 230*1 + 10*0.5 + 10*0 =235. The same "
 "reasoning is valid for the green and the blue squares."
 msgstr ""
+"I den röda rutan är bildpunktsvärdena 230;10;10 och de relativa värdena är "
+"1;0,5;0. Beräkningen blir 230 × 1 + 10 × 0,5 + 10 × 0 = 235. Samma beräkning"
+" gäller för de gröna och blå rutorna."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:155(para)
+#| msgid ""
+#| "In the gray square, which contains red color, the calculation result is "
+#| "above 255. It is reduced to 255. A negative value would be reduced to 0."
 msgid ""
 "In the gray square, which contains red color, the calculation result is "
 "above 255. It is set to 255. A negative value would be set to 0."
 msgstr ""
+"I den grå rutan, som innehåller rött, blir beräkningsresultatet större än "
+"255 och begränsas till 255. Ett negativt värde begränsas till 0."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:164(title)
 msgid ""
-"Output channel is red. Green Channel +50%. The Preserve Luminosity option is "
-"checked."
-msgstr ""
+"Output channel is red. Green Channel +50%. The Preserve Luminosity option is"
+" checked."
+msgstr ""
+"Utdatakanalen är röd. Grön kanal +50 %. Alternativet Bevara ljusstyrka är "
+"markerat."
 
 #: src/menus/colors/components/channel-mixer.xml:174(para)
+#| msgid ""
+#| "The values attributed to the Red Output channel are lower, preventing a too "
+#| "much clear image."
 msgid ""
 "The values attributed to the Red Output channel are lower, preventing a too "
 "bright image."
 msgstr ""
+"Värdena som tilldelas den röda utdatakanalen är lägre, vilket förhindrar att"
+" bilden blir för ljus."
 
